                                <section>
                                    <header>Welcome to your new Exponential website</header>
                                    <paragraph>You chose the website interface with a clean install: the site has its design, its menus and this front page, and no demo content, so it is ready for yours.</paragraph>
                                    <paragraph>To add content, <link href="/user/login">sign in</link> with the "admin" user and the password you chose during the installation. Editors can edit right on the page with the website sidebar, or use the administration interface for the structure of the site.</paragraph>
                                    <paragraph>Exponential 6.0.15 brings front-end editing, the Velocity application server, Exponential Layouts and support for five databases. Read the documentation at <link href="https://doc.exponential.earth">doc.exponential.earth</link>, find the source code on <link href="https://github.com/se7enxweb/exponential">GitHub</link>, and ask <link href="https://se7enx.com">7x</link> for hosting, support and training.</paragraph>
